-- EVT ui_clean, menu title_menu_2 (the title / main menu): the «Deluxe Edition» button becomes a plain badge.
-- Retail (title_menu_2 SetupDlcBuyBtn_Coroutine / OnEnter): layer title02_21_dlc_buy_btn (layout title02_21) is a white
